---
// Tactic sweep: per-tactic change in refusal rate with MDE whiskers, re-sortable by
// in-the-wild usage, with a cursor-following tooltip carrying the exact carrier
// template. Generated from runs/tactics_summary.json and src/tactics.py.
//
// Re-sorting moves rows with a CSS transform rather than reordering the DOM, so the
// animation is cheap but keyboard tab order keeps the effect-sorted sequence. Screen
// reader users get each row's template and figures from its aria-label either way.
